  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shang Pu Lao presses Fang Yuan to take the captive Wei clansmen in Shang Clan City, recalling that Wei clan leader’s guard troops once blocked five rank three Gu Masters at once. Fang Yuan summons her for a private talk, orders her to raise a loyal female guard force for Shang Xin Ci and to steady the Wei clansmen, and shows he already knows she is pregnant, means to preserve her husband’s only bloodline, and plans to contact her younger brother Wei Shen Jing for revenge.",
      "chapters": [
        330
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_pu_lao",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "fac_wei_clan",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_shang_xin_ci",
        "char_wei_shen_jing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He tells her to help Shang Xin Ci and not seek Wei Shen Jing for a time, saying her brother has already been recruited by Wu clan and is being monitored. In Fang Yuan’s previous life she helped Shang Pu Lao rise in the young master contest, then with Wei Shen Jing aided Wu clan against Shang clan after Wei clan fell, and became known as the first person to make Shang Yan Fei suffer a loss.",
      "chapters": [
        331
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "char_shang_yan_fei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Shang Xin Ci in charge, Zhou Quan assisting, and her cooperation with the Xiong brothers, the intel business in the battle stage is established.",
      "chapters": [
        333
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_quan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Although Wei De Xin’s face is filthy, it cannot hide her beautiful peach-like appearance. She has a delicate body. She is pregnant.",
      "chapters": [
        330
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Shang clan’s succession ceremony on Shang Liang Mountain, she stands as the leader of Shang Xin Ci’s guards after nurturing elite guards under Fang Yuan’s earlier threat. She has already given birth. Wei Shen Jing writes urging her to serve Wu clan with him; she is moved yet decides she cannot leave Shang Xin Ci, and with Zhou Quan helps write Shang Xin Ci’s public speech.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shang-clan-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_liang_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the smoky warm jade field she is again named the wife of Wei clan leader, once bought as a slave by Fang Yuan and given to Shang Xin Ci, now Shang Xin Ci’s personal guard, loyal and seeking only to repay gratitude.",
      "chapters": [
        1531
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "smoky-warm-jade-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Schemers leave her and Zhou Quan bedridden. She sends to Wei Shen Jing for help and hands Shang Xin Ci an information path Gu worm that Shang Xin Ci refuses to take.",
      "chapters": [
        2123
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fake-gu-crisis",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Zhou Quan she encircles Shang Ya Zi and the others in second inner city over fake Gu. Clansmen call her Commander Wei De Xin, one of Shang Xin Ci’s most loyal subordinates, as she and Zhou Quan present the gathered fake Gu and press the case.",
      "chapters": [
        2125
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "second-inner-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_ya_zi"
      ]
    }
  ],
